Patch for gpui-pre-windows 0.3.8 (src/), which is derived from GPUI
(https://github.com/zed-industries/zed, crates/gpui_windows) and licensed under
the Apache License 2.0. Modified for the UME Editor PoC, to investigate issue #23
(slow startup on Windows x64). It only adds measurements and switches:

- POC_TRACE_STARTUP=1: prints the wall time and the thread's CPU time of each
  startup step of the platform (DirectWrite, DXGI, D3D11 device).
- POC_FONT_NO_UPDATE_CHECK=1: calls GetSystemFontCollection with
  checkForUpdates = false at startup.
- POC_D3D_TWICE=1: creates the D3D11 device a second time, to time it warm.
- POC_PRELOAD=<driver dir>: loads the NVIDIA driver's DLLs before creating the
  device, to time the loads.

Apply in a copy of the crate with `patch -p1`.

